am is the largest single buyer of grid equipment in Caldria.\n  - Norvane Utilities plans spending up 12%, with a C$450M tender in Q2 2027.\n  - VLTX holdings won 60% of the last tender round.\n  - VLTX utility order intake has risen each quarter: C$610M in 2025Q4, then C$640M, C$655M and C$670M in 2026Q3.\n- **Data centres (still growing, but slowing):**\n  - Grid connection requests are expected to grow 9% in 2027, slower than in 2026, because power availability is limiting new sites.\n  - The connection queue grew 4% in Q3 2026. Data centres are 60% of new requests, and the average wait is 26 months. Long waits cap how fast equipment orders can follow.\n\n**Caveats:**\n- The sources give 2027 capex growth but no 2026 baseline in C$ terms.\n- I did not find the VLTX customer-mix document, so I can't say how much of VLTX's orders depend on Pellham and Norvane.\n- Whether the utilities can finance these plans is a separate question that node n3 is covering.","ttft_ms":5016,"type":"result","duration_ms":61130,"uuid":"6c3430d1-4c4b-4c79-898b-cbead255c8da","ttft_stream_ms":3956,"time_to_request_ms":249,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":16,"system_prompt":9,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":5,"input_attachments":40,"input_hooks":6,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":9,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":24,"init_frame_send":7,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":10,"message_prep":8,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":5,"request_announcements":39,"query_setup":5,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":15,"message_normalization":15,"client_creation":21,"request_build":14},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":131,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":74,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":204,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":131,"process_rss_mib_result":201,"process_anon_mib_result":120,"process_peak_rss_mib":206,"process_cpu_ms_turn":641,"process_wall_ms_turn":61130,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":77,"process_wal